</span>
</div>
<div class="note-content"><map name="FPMap12"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#consciousness" shape="rect" coords="50, 3, 81, 25"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#mind" shape="rect" coords="170, 2, 201, 28"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#manifestation" shape="rect" coords="285, 1, 316, 27"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#first" shape="rect" coords="2, 16, 23, 45"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#second" shape="rect" coords="1, 71, 23, 105"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#third" shape="rect" coords="1, 131, 24, 164"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#fourth" shape="rect" coords="2, 188, 25, 222"> </map> <div class="fact" answer="yes"> <p> You are not required to identify yourself unless you are legally detained, under arrest, or are a material witness to some crime. You can object but sometimes police officers are less than dispassionate so, objecting to anything they say can bring their wrath down on you. So be careful. </p> </div></div>
