<button class="no-button tiny" data-node-id="node_6" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="">No</button>
</span>
</div>
<div class="note-content"><map name="FPMap12"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#consciousness" shape="rect" coords="50, 3, 81, 25"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#mind" shape="rect" coords="170, 2, 201, 28"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#manifestation" shape="rect" coords="285, 1, 316, 27"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#first" shape="rect" coords="2, 16, 23, 45"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#second" shape="rect" coords="1, 71, 23, 105"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#third" shape="rect" coords="1, 131, 24, 164"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#fourth" shape="rect" coords="2, 188, 25, 222"> </map> <div class="fact" answer="yes"> <p> If you were not aware that you were legally detained, under arrest, or a material witness, you had a right to raise an objection but it often occurs that the officer will arrest you for any resistance of any kind. However, if you were arrested for failure to identify when the officer did not establish his authority to require you to identify yourself, you have a claim for false arrest and imprisonment. </p> </div></div>
