<li class="node-level-6" id="node_9" data-answer-type="yes" style="display:none;">
<div class="node-container">
<div class="node-content-stack">
<div class="node-text note-trigger" data-original-text="Yes - Did the officer verify that there was a warrant for your arrest?">
<span class="question-text">Yes - Did the officer verify that there was a warrant for your arrest?</span>
<span class="inline-buttons">
<button class="yes-button tiny" data-node-id="node_9" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="">Yes</button>
<button class="no-button tiny" data-node-id="node_9" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="node_10">No</button>
</span>
</div>
<div class="note-content"><p> An arrest is considered a serious incursion onto the rights of a citizen. An arrest is not not supported by a mere belief in the existence of a warrant, the officer has a dutu to confirm the belief before making an arrest. </p></div>
</div>
<div class="question-comment always-visible">
<input type="text" class="comment-textbox" placeholder="Leave comments or questions here" size="50" id="textbox-node_9">
