<li class="node-level-7" id="node_10" data-answer-type="no" style="display:none;">
<div class="node-container">
<div class="node-content-stack">
<div class="node-text note-trigger" data-original-text="No - Were you arrested on mere suspicion of the existence of a warrant?">
<span class="question-text">No - Were you arrested on mere suspicion of the existence of a warrant?</span>
<span class="inline-buttons">
<button class="yes-button tiny" data-node-id="node_10" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="node_11">Yes</button>
<button class="no-button tiny" data-node-id="node_10" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="">No</button>
</span>
</div>
<div class="note-content"><p> If you were arrested on a mere suspicion, the arrest can be contested as wrongful on it's face. Even if there was a warrant, an arrest by an officer merely on the suspicion of a warrant is wrongful. </p></div>
</div>
<div class="question-comment always-visible">
