<button class="no-button tiny" data-node-id="node_51" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="node_55">No</button>
</span>
</div>
<div class="note-content"><p> If the officer is unable to locate a magistrate for an examining trial, s/he is authorized to hold you for as long as it reasonable takes to locate a magistrate. </p></div>
