<li class="node-level-10" id="node_281" data-answer-type="no" style="display:none;">
<div class="node-container">
<div class="node-content-stack">
<div class="node-text note-trigger" data-original-text="No - Were you taken directly to jail?">
<span class="question-text">No - Were you taken directly to jail?</span>
<span class="inline-buttons">
<button class="yes-button tiny" data-node-id="node_281" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="">Yes</button>
<button class="no-button tiny" data-node-id="node_281" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="node_285">No</button>
</span>
</div>
<div class="note-content"><p> If you were taken directly to jail by the arresting officer, having made no due diligent effort to locate a magistrate, you will have a claim of false imprisonment against the officer. </p></div>
</div>
<div class="question-comment always-visible">
