<span class="question-text">No - Were you taken directly to jail?</span>
<span class="inline-buttons">
<button class="yes-button tiny" data-node-id="node_377" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="">Yes</button>
<button class="no-button tiny" data-node-id="node_377" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="node_381">No</button>
</span>
</div>
<div class="note-content"><p> If you were taken directly to jail by the arresting officer, having made no due diligent effort to locate a magistrate, you will have a claim of false imprisonment against the officer. </p></div>
