<li class="node-level-3" id="node_400" data-answer-type="yes" style="display:none;">
<div class="node-container">
<div class="node-content-stack">
<div class="node-text note-trigger" data-original-text="Yes -- Did you raise an objection to identifying yourself?">
<span class="question-text">Yes -- Did you raise an objection to identifying yourself?</span>
<span class="inline-buttons">
<button class="yes-button tiny" data-node-id="node_400" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="node_401">Yes</button>
<button class="no-button tiny" data-node-id="node_400" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="node_504">No</button>
</span>
</div>
<div class="note-content"><map name="FPMap12"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#consciousness" shape="rect" coords="50, 3, 81, 25"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#mind" shape="rect" coords="170, 2, 201, 28"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#manifestation" shape="rect" coords="285, 1, 316, 27"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#first" shape="rect" coords="2, 16, 23, 45"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#second" shape="rect" coords="1, 71, 23, 105"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#third" shape="rect" coords="1, 131, 24, 164"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#fourth" shape="rect" coords="2, 188, 25, 222"> </map> <div class="fact" answer="yes"> <p> You are not required to identify yourself unless you are legally detained, under arrest, or are a material witness to some crime. You can object but sometimes police officers are less than dispassionate so, objecting to anything they say can bring their wrath down on you. So be careful. </p> </div></div>
</div>
<div class="question-comment always-visible">
<input type="text" class="comment-textbox" placeholder="Leave comments or questions here" size="50" id="textbox-node_400">
</div>
</div>
<ul class="child-nodes" data-parent-id="node_400" style="display:none;">
<li class="node-level-4" id="node_401" data-answer-type="yes" style="display:none;">
<div class="node-container">
<div class="node-content-stack">
<div class="node-text note-trigger" data-original-text="Yes -- Did the officer arrest you for failure to identify?">
<span class="question-text">Yes -- Did the officer arrest you for failure to identify?</span>
<span class="inline-buttons">
<button class="yes-button tiny" data-node-id="node_401" data-hyperlink="../Fail%20to%20Identify/Fail%20to%20Identify.html" data-child-id="node_402">Yes</button>
<button class="no-button tiny" data-node-id="node_401" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="">No</button>
</span>
</div>
<div class="note-content"><map name="FPMap12"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#consciousness" shape="rect" coords="50, 3, 81, 25"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#mind" shape="rect" coords="170, 2, 201, 28"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#manifestation" shape="rect" coords="285, 1, 316, 27"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#first" shape="rect" coords="2, 16, 23, 45"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#second" shape="rect" coords="1, 71, 23, 105"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#third" shape="rect" coords="1, 131, 24, 164"> <area href="http://www.swamij.com/levelsdimensions.htm#fourth" shape="rect" coords="2, 188, 25, 222"> </map> <div class="fact" answer="yes"> <p> If you were not aware that you were legally detained, under arrest, or a material witness, you had a right to raise an objection but it often occurs that the officer will arrest you for any resistance of any kind. However, if you were arrested for failure to identify when the officer did not establish his authority to require you to identify yourself, you have a claim for false arrest and imprisonment. </p> </div></div>
</div>
<div class="question-comment always-visible">
<input type="text" class="comment-textbox" placeholder="Leave comments or questions here" size="50" id="textbox-node_401">
</div>
</div>
<ul class="child-nodes" data-parent-id="node_401" style="display:none;">
<li class="node-level-5" id="node_403" data-answer-type="yes" style="display:none;">
<div class="node-container">
<div class="node-content-stack">
<div class="node-text" data-original-text="Yes -- Were you detained because the officer had reason to believe there was a warrant for your arrest?">
<span class="question-text">Yes -- Were you detained because the officer had reason to believe there was a warrant for your arrest?</span>
<span class="inline-buttons">
<button class="yes-button tiny" data-node-id="node_403" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="node_404">Yes</button>
<button class="no-button tiny" data-node-id="node_403" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="node_439">No</button>
</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="question-comment always-visible">
<input type="text" class="comment-textbox" placeholder="Leave comments or questions here" size="50" id="textbox-node_403">
</div>
</div>
<ul class="child-nodes" data-parent-id="node_403" style="display:none;">
<li class="node-level-6" id="node_404" data-answer-type="yes" style="display:none;">
<div class="node-container">
<div class="node-content-stack">
<div class="node-text note-trigger" data-original-text="Yes - Did the officer verify that there was a warrant for your arrest?">
<span class="question-text">Yes - Did the officer verify that there was a warrant for your arrest?</span>
<span class="inline-buttons">
<button class="yes-button tiny" data-node-id="node_404" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="">Yes</button>
<button class="no-button tiny" data-node-id="node_404" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="node_405">No</button>
</span>
</div>
<div class="note-content"><p> An arrest is considered a serious incursion onto the rights of a citizen. An arrest is not not supported by a mere belief in the existence of a warrant, the officer has a dutu to confirm the belief before making an arrest. </p></div>
</div>
<div class="question-comment always-visible">
<input type="text" class="comment-textbox" placeholder="Leave comments or questions here" size="50" id="textbox-node_404">
</div>
</div>
<ul class="child-nodes" data-parent-id="node_404" style="display:none;">
<li class="node-level-7" id="node_405" data-answer-type="no" style="display:none;">
<div class="node-container">
<div class="node-content-stack">
<div class="node-text note-trigger" data-original-text="No - Were you arrested on mere suspicion of the existence of a warrant?">
<span class="question-text">No - Were you arrested on mere suspicion of the existence of a warrant?</span>
<span class="inline-buttons">
<button class="yes-button tiny" data-node-id="node_405" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="node_406">Yes</button>
<button class="no-button tiny" data-node-id="node_405" data-hyperlink="" data-child-id="">No</button>
</span>
</div>
<div class="note-content"><p> If you were arrested on a mere suspicion, the arrest can be contested as wrongful on it's face. Even if there was a warrant, an arrest by an officer merely on the suspicion of a warrant is wrongful. </p></div>
</div>
<div class="question-comment always-visible">
<input type="text" class="comment-textbox" placeholder="Leave comments or questions here" size="50" id="textbox-node_405">
</div>
</div>
<ul class="child-nodes" data-parent-id="node_405" style="display:none;">
<li class="node-level-8" id="node_406" data-answer-type="yes" style="display:none;">
